# 4YOU – Mental Health Support Platform for Students

**4YOU** is a full-stack web application designed to provide mental health resources, emotional journaling, mood tracking, and access to counselor support — all in one safe and student-friendly space.

---

## 🧩 Features

- 🧠 Curated Mental Health Resources (Articles, Videos, Audios)
- 💬 Anonymous Journaling & Emotional Sharing
- 💭 Peer Support Forum for Discussions
- 📊 Mood, Energy & Stress Tracker
- 👩‍⚕️ Connect with Verified Counselors
- 🔐 Secure Authentication (Student/Admin)
- 📱 Responsive UI for Web and Mobile



## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend:
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript

### Backend:
- Node.js, Express.js
- MongoDB + Mongoose

### Deployment:
- Render 
- MongoDB Atlas (Database)

---

## 🗃️ API Endpoints

Here are a few sample routes:

| Method | Endpoint                     | Description              |
|--------|------------------------------|--------------------------|
| POST   | `/api/auth/register`         | Register new user       |
| POST   | `/api/auth/login`            | Student login           |
| POST   | `/api/auth/admin-login`      | Admin login             |
| GET    | `/api/resources`             | Get mental health content |
| POST   | `/api/journal`               | Submit journal entry    |
| POST   | `/api/forum`                 | Create forum discussion |
| GET    | `/api/counselors`            | List available counselors |

